<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz June unemployment 6.4 pct (6.8 pct in May).</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz June unemployment 6.4 pct (6.8 pct in May).</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's unemployment rate fell to 59,400 people or 6.4 percent of the workforce at the end of June from 62,600 people or 6.8 percent in May, the National Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ UNEMPLOYMENT	 June 97     May 97    June 96</p>
<p>    officially registered	59,400     62,600    80,000</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	6.4	  6.8	 4.6</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for the total number of unemployed in 1997 are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
